WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.800
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today, I’m&nbsp;
going to explain a film based on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.480
real-life story of the youngest warrior&nbsp;
of World War II called “Soldier Boy.” 
&nbsp;

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:17.920
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
The movie begins in Russia where a family&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:23.360
of three sit by the river, enjoying their&nbsp;
time. The youngest of them, Sergei Alyoshkov,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:27.600
boasts to his elder brother and mother about&nbsp;
him being on top of a tree, when suddenly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:32.800
German fighter jets fly overhead. The mother asks&nbsp;
her kids to quickly hide in the bushes, but the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:38.240
six-year-old claims he is not scared and strikes&nbsp;
the jet with a slingshot. To everyone’s surprise,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:44.240
he manages to hit the jets and explode them. But&nbsp;
when he looks around, his family is gone. Sergei&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:48.880
wakes up frightened from the dream and calls for&nbsp;
his mother. Just then, someone knocks on his door.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:54.000
Assuming it is his mother, he runs towards&nbsp;
it, but a neighbor woman comes in panicking.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.800
She thanks God for keeping him alive, and informs&nbsp;
him that his mother and brother are dead. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:03.040
little boy cannot comprehend what she is saying,&nbsp;
and wants to stay in the house to wait for his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:07.200
mother. The woman tells him that the Germans have&nbsp;
attacked them and that he should run away. 
&nbsp;

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.960
Just then, some soldiers approach their house. The&nbsp;
woman makes Sergei run out through the window but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:18.400
is shot dead before she can join him. The little&nbsp;
six-year-old is now on his own, with no family and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:23.760
friends. As Sergei runs away from the house, he&nbsp;
sees his whole neighborhood burning behind him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:28.480
He calls for his mother in vain, and runs&nbsp;
away from there. After running for a while,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:32.400
he ends up in the middle of the woods. The&nbsp;
little kid starts to call for his mother to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:38.160
come and get him, because he is lost. That night,&nbsp;
he stays in the jungle. The following morning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:41.840
we see him drink water from a river,&nbsp;
when the enemy soldiers approach his way.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:46.960
Sergei, knowing that they are dangerous,&nbsp;
quickly hides inside a tree's roots.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:50.960
He is startled when a snake comes nearby,&nbsp;
but doesn’t utter a word or run away.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:56.720
Sergei is more scared of the soldiers than of the&nbsp;
snake. The soldiers eat by the river and go away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:00.000
after which Sergei takes their leftover&nbsp;
food and devours it for the night. 
&nbsp;

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:06.160
However, by the end of the day, the little boy is&nbsp;
exhausted. He hasn’t had a proper meal in two days&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:11.760
and has been walking with no destination. He falls&nbsp;
down as he limps but doesn’t stop walking. While&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:17.280
on his way, he sees wild berries and devours them;&nbsp;
but just then, an explosion occurs behind him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:22.960
taking him by surprise. The boy gets dizzy, and&nbsp;
starts to hallucinate someone coming behind him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:27.440
However, even in such conditions, he stands&nbsp;
brave and tells the person he has a rifle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:31.440
and is not scared. He limps forward&nbsp;
but falls unconscious after a while.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:36.800
While he is asleep, two soldiers approach him.&nbsp;
The scene cuts to the Russian army base where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:40.800
Commander Kuznetsov waits for his patrol&nbsp;
soldiers. They come in with the little kid&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:45.840
who is injured and weak. When the soldiers claim&nbsp;
they are on his side, the little boy opens up and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:50.480
introduces himself. The soldiers laugh when&nbsp;
the kid shakes his hand with the commander,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:54.640
suggesting he introduce himself too. 
The soldiers feel affectionate with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:58.720
the little kid, and circle him around.&nbsp;
They make him drink water and feed him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:04.320
Even the otherwise cold commander takes care of&nbsp;
the kid. A nurse named Katya dresses Sergei’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:09.680
wounds, and is charmed by his personality too. The&nbsp;
kid asks her to draw a tank on his wounds, because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:14.320
he wants to be a soldier when he grows up. Even&nbsp;
the injured soldiers talk to the kid, and feel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:19.760
lighter. Sergei is fascinated with the commander’s&nbsp;
gun and his batch. The commander too answers all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:24.240
the little boy’s questions and lets him play with&nbsp;
his honorary pistol after taking the bullets out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:29.920
Sergei shows him the tank drawn on his stomach,&nbsp;
and boasts about being a soldier himself. The boy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:34.880
is healing very quickly. The nurse Katya asks the&nbsp;
commander to let the boy stay with the battalion,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:40.240
but he disagrees, claiming that it won’t be safe;&nbsp;
he wants to send Sergei to an orphanage. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:45.520
soldiers spent all their free time with Sergei.&nbsp;
He is visited by many throughout the day. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:49.840
bring him food sent by their families from afar,&nbsp;
and even let him play with their binoculars. 
&nbsp;

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:55.520
One day, a soldier goes to the commander to&nbsp;
ask him to let the boy stay with the battalion.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:59.120
The soldiers have grown a close connection&nbsp;
with the kid, and think of him as their own.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:04.480
His presence takes the weight of war off their&nbsp;
chest. However, the commander is adamant about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:09.680
sending the boy to the orphanage, for his own&nbsp;
safety. The following day, the enemies attack,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:14.960
and many soldiers are hurt. A vehicle comes to&nbsp;
fetch Sergei to take him to the orphanage. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:19.920
commander breaks the news to the kid ,and gives&nbsp;
him a wooden honorary pistol as a gift. The boy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:24.720
in turn hugs him, claiming that he is scared for&nbsp;
the commander’s safety. The commander melts in his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:30.880
embrace, and changes his mind. He asks Sergei to&nbsp;
stay with the soldiers as his son. That night, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:35.040
soldiers look for little soldier clothes for the&nbsp;
little boy, they are over the moon to have Sergei&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:40.080
stay with them. The commander wakes Sergei up&nbsp;
and gives him the clothes. He wears them and runs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:44.640
around, looking like a real soldier. The others&nbsp;
start calling him their little soldier boy. 
&nbsp;

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:50.960
As the kid runs around, the Germans launch an air&nbsp;
attack on the battalion. The soldiers quickly take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:56.800
Sergei to a safe place and fight the others. The&nbsp;
number of injured soldiers grows rapidly. Sergei&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.800 --> 00:05:02.000
wants to make himself useful, so he brings water&nbsp;
to thirsty soldiers. One of them asks him to read&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:06.560
a letter sent by his family because he has a&nbsp;
bandage over his eyes. The little boy wants to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:10.960
help, but doesn’t know how to read. He takes the&nbsp;
letter and starts making up the things written on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:16.080
it, claiming that the soldier’s cow is safe back&nbsp;
home. When the soldier says he doesn’t have a cow,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:20.640
the others tell him to go along with the story&nbsp;
and laugh. He reads everyone else’s letters&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:25.280
in the same fashion and cheers them up. 
In the following scene, we see Katya and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:30.240
Commander talking. The two seem to be attracted&nbsp;
to each other, but do not confess their feelings.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:35.440
Later, Sergei tells the Commander that he is of&nbsp;
the orderly position in the battalion and starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:40.560
introducing himself as one. However, the boy then&nbsp;
sees one of the soldier’s station destroyed from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:44.960
the attack. The commander teaches him to take his&nbsp;
hat off to pay respect to the dead soldier. 
&nbsp;

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:50.320
The next day, he insists the commander give him&nbsp;
a mission and is given a task to distribute the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:54.640
letters among the soldiers. He completes his&nbsp;
task efficiently and even makes the soldiers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.640 --> 00:06:00.240
dance for him. The following day, Sergei goes&nbsp;
a little far from the base with his binoculars.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:05.040
As he is playing with it, he sees someone’s leg&nbsp;
moving from inside a haystack, he rushes back to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:09.440
the battalion and tells the soldiers about&nbsp;
his findings. The soldiers are skeptical,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:14.400
but go with the boy anyway. When they reach near&nbsp;
the haystack, they are alerted to see two German&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:20.000
spies hiding underneath. The spies are arrested,&nbsp;
and the kid is praised for his intelligence.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:25.200
That night, the commander shows Sergei the legal&nbsp;
papers for his adoption. He is now officially the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:30.880
kid’s father. Sergei knows of the commander’s&nbsp;
feelings for Katya, so, to repay his kindness,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:35.600
he takes him to confess to her. But the two see&nbsp;
her talking to a different man, and wrongfully&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:40.000
assume she is interested in someone else. 
The base is attacked by the Germans again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:45.600
This time, Sergei helps the soldiers with all his&nbsp;
might, by supplying ammunition to the soldiers in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:49.920
the frontline, but the soldiers there command him&nbsp;
to go back to the shed because it is too dangerous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:54.960
outside. When he comes to the shed, he sees the&nbsp;
commander and others panicking because the phone’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:54.960 --> 00:07:00.640
connection with the colonel is lost. A soldier is&nbsp;
sent to fix the broken wires. Sergei follows the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:05.760
soldier and sees he has been fatally wounded. He&nbsp;
asks the dying soldier how he can fix the wires,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:10.000
and does it himself. The connection&nbsp;
comes back and more troops are called.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:15.120
The six years old saves everyone’s life. 
Later, we see the commander and Katya talking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:19.920
by the river. The commander finally confesses his&nbsp;
love for her and asks her to be Sergei’s mother.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:25.360
Katya is over the moon, but before she can say&nbsp;
anything, a soldier approaches them and gives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:30.080
the commander a letter, saying they have been&nbsp;
dispatched from the base. The following day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:34.640
all the soldiers leave for their new base&nbsp;
along with Sergei. However, on their way,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:38.880
they come across a minefield that blows off some&nbsp;
of their vehicles. The commander is hurt while the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:44.880
group’s orderly, who Sergei was close with, dies&nbsp;
in the explosion. He cries and hugs the commander.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:48.320
They carry the injured ones with them and&nbsp;
continue their journey to their new base. 
&nbsp;

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:52.400
When they finally reach the other&nbsp;
base, they meet the commander’s leader,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:57.360
the General. He too is impressed by the kid’s&nbsp;
ambition, and congratulates the commander for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:57.360 --> 00:08:02.240
having such a smart kid. The following day,&nbsp;
their division is awarded a guard’s banner,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:06.720
and so is the boy. He promises to save his&nbsp;
country when the general gives him his batch. 
&nbsp;

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:12.320
One night, their base is attacked brutally,&nbsp;
and the commander is trapped under the ruins.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:16.720
Sergei cries for his father and tries to&nbsp;
save him. He calls the other soldiers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:21.040
who finally bring the commander out.
The next day, Sergei approaches an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:24.560
injured commander, his hands were hurt&nbsp;
while trying to save the commander.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:29.520
The kid is now an inseparable part of the team.&nbsp;
He doesn’t have a family beside them, and moves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:34.230
wherever they go in the war. The movie ends as&nbsp;
the regiment is seen moving to another base.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:38.560
A voice in the background narrates that he&nbsp;
even took part in the Stalingrad battle,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:42.960
and reached Poland with the soldiers. He is&nbsp;
currently known as the world’s youngest soldier&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:47.120
ever, and the legendary story of his bravery,&nbsp;
is now spread for the whole world to hear.
